@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5167
@welfareOfficerToken = replace-with-welfare-officer-jwt
@termId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### View anonymised case statistics for an academic term
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WelfareStatistics?termId={{termId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{welfareOfficerToken}}

### View anonymised case statistics for a UTC calendar-date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WelfareStatistics?fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-06-30
Authorization: Bearer {{welfareOfficerToken}}

### Export anonymised case statistics as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WelfareStatistics/export?termId={{termId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{welfareOfficerToken}}

### Invalid: one date is not a complete date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WelfareStatistics?fromDate=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{welfareOfficerToken}}

### Invalid: term and date range cannot be combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WelfareStatistics?termId={{termId}}&fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-06-30
Authorization: Bearer {{welfareOfficerToken}}
